LangString TextRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Anyview is running. Close it, then click Retry."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "Anyview 正在运行。请先关闭它，再点“重试”。"
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_TRADCHINESE} "Anyview 正在執行。請先關閉它，再按一下「重試」。"
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_JAPANESE} "Anyviewが実行中です。閉じてから「再試行」をクリックしてください。"
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_KOREAN} "Anyview가 실행 중입니다. Anyview를 닫은 후 ‘다시 시도’를 클릭하세요."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_SPANISH} "Anyview se está ejecutando. Hay que cerrarlo y hacer clic en Reintentar."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_FRENCH} "Anyview est en cours d’exécution. Fermez-le, puis cliquez sur Réessayer."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_GERMAN} "Anyview läuft gerade. Bitte Anyview schließen und dann auf „Wiederholen“ klicken."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_PORTUGUESEBR} "O Anyview está em execução. Feche-o e clique em Repetir."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_RUSSIAN} "Anyview запущен. Закройте его и повторите попытку."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_ITALIAN} "Anyview è in esecuzione. Chiuderlo, quindi fare clic su Riprova."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_TURKISH} "Anyview çalışıyor. Lütfen kapatıp yeniden deneyin."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_POLISH} "Anyview jest uruchomiony. Zamknij go, a następnie kliknij „Ponów próbę”."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_DUTCH} "Anyview is actief. Sluit het programma af en klik daarna op ‘Opnieuw’."
LangString TextRunning ${LANG_VIETNAMESE} "Anyview đang chạy. Hãy đóng Anyview rồi bấm Thử lại."
